GOOD TO KNOW
------------
   - Never edit blog/index.html, blog/posts.json or blog/sitemap.xml by hand: the Worker rewrites
     them on every save and your change would be lost.
   - GitHub Desktop often says "pull first". That is normal: the Worker makes a commit every time
     a post is saved, so the server is usually ahead of your computer.
   - A file only reaches the site after you save it in the editor, commit it, AND push it.
   - The Google Analytics tag lives in blog/template.html. Do not remove it when editing the
     template, or new and rebuilt posts stop being counted.
